  "summary_zh": "塞里雅蘭瀑布，除了冬季外，可以步行到瀑布裡面，也稱作「水濂洞瀑布」，記得帶上雨衣。\n\n每年的 10 月中到隔年的 3 月中，往往因為下雪，通往瀑布後方的步道會結冰、封路。\n\n旁邊的「隱士瀑布」也值得一去，單程步行約 800 公尺，10-15  分鐘可以抵達，如果你也想規畫進來的話，那麼這裡建議 保留 2HR 較不會太趕。\n\n前面的「紀念品店」有販賣一些別處沒有的紀念品，記得去那裡看看。",
  "summary_en": "You can walk behind Seljalandsfoss (also called “Waterfall Cave”) except in winter, so bring a raincoat. From mid‑October to mid‑March the path behind the falls often freezes and is closed due to snow. Nearby “Hidden Waterfall” is worth a visit; it’s about an 800 m (10‑15 min) walk one‑way, and you should allow about 2 hours to see both sites without rushing. There is a paid parking lot, free toilets, a viewing platform, and dining options on site. The souvenir shop sells items you won’t find elsewhere, so be sure to check it out.",
